---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Section from '../common/Section.astro';
import scheduleBoard from '../../ktm-2024/images/schedule.jpeg';
---
<Section>
  <p class="font-display font-light text-lead text-ink">An <span class="text-brand">unconference</span> is a gathering <b class="font-bold">for attendees, by attendees</b>. A few talks open the day. After that there is no schedule, not until the sessions go up on <b class="font-bold">one big physical timetable</b> and the room decides where to be.</p>

  <figure class="mt-10">
    <a
      href={scheduleBoard.src}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="block rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-line bg-card"
    >
      <Image
        src={scheduleBoard}
        alt="The session board at BarCamp Kathmandu 2024: a wall-sized grid of tracks and time slots, filled in by hand with session cards."
        widths={[640, 940, 1880]}
        sizes="(min-width: 940px) 888px, 100vw"
        class="w-full h-auto block"
      />
    </a>
    <figcaption class="font-mono text-[12px] text-faint mt-3">The board at BarCamp Kathmandu 2024. Every slot filled by whoever turned up.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</Section>
